# Copy this file to user_defines.txt and edit. user_defines.txt is .gitignored.
#
# At minimum set MY_BINDING_PHRASE — it is hashed into the 6-byte UID that
# pairs this backpack with an ELRS TX module. Pick the same phrase as the TX
# module is bound with, or leave commented out for the upstream default.

#-DMY_BINDING_PHRASE="my-secret-phrase"

# Optional: WiFi credentials for the OTA update web UI. If unset, the device
# falls back to AP mode on first boot.
#-DHOME_WIFI_SSID=""
#-DHOME_WIFI_PASSWORD=""

# Optional debug logging. The DEBUG_LOG_VERBOSE form is spammy.
#-DDEBUG_LOG
#-DDEBUG_LOG_VERBOSE
